   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`h [T, 6144]  → next layer`"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-layerp",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1300,
   "y": 1724,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "Per layer: SWA attention **267.4M**, GA attention **267.4M** (same 128 Q / 8 KV heads; SWA adds only the 128 sink logits — Flash's GA had 4 KV heads), router 2.4M, 384 experts × 37.7M = **14.50B** stored, 8 × 37.7M = 302.0M used per token. No shared expert (`n_shared_experts: null`)."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-l0",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 50,
   "y": 1724,
   "width": 1250,
   "height": 110,
   "text": "**L0** differs: global attention and a dense SwiGLU FFN 6144 → 16384 → 6144 (302.0M) instead of the MoE. The 3 MTP blocks use SWA attention with the same dense FFN shape."
  }
